WEBVTT

00:51.551 --> 00:52.719
That's the alchemy of souls?

01:07.567 --> 01:11.112
Is my soul being shifted right now?

02:59.971 --> 03:01.389
I'm in my body.

03:02.932 --> 03:04.058
What just happened?

03:12.066 --> 03:13.109
Jang Uk.

03:14.152 --> 03:15.028
Jang Uk.

03:18.489 --> 03:19.449
Jang Uk.

03:20.909 --> 03:21.826
Jang Uk.

03:37.217 --> 03:40.845
Gil-ju, you bastard!
You managed to steal his body after all.

03:42.680 --> 03:43.514
Mu-deok.

03:47.518 --> 03:50.104
I was not strong enough
to protect him from you.

03:50.939 --> 03:53.441
But I will not allow you
to live in my pupil's body.

03:59.239 --> 04:00.365
I didn't know…

04:01.282 --> 04:03.284
that you cared so much about Jang Uk.

04:04.035 --> 04:05.203
Shut up!

04:07.372 --> 04:08.456
Stop it!

04:09.624 --> 04:10.750
It's me, Jang Uk.

04:11.668 --> 04:12.919
Our souls didn't shift.

04:15.463 --> 04:16.965
Mu-deok, look into my eyes.

04:18.383 --> 04:19.842
Can't you tell it's me?

04:24.347 --> 04:27.016
I'm the only person who can look at you
this close, remember?

04:30.812 --> 04:32.021
Don't you recognize me?

05:53.728 --> 05:55.980
He had the blue mark
of a shifter on his body.

05:57.857 --> 06:00.735
His soul must have re-entered his own body
instead of entering into mine.

06:01.819 --> 06:03.112
But why didn't I change?

06:03.196 --> 06:04.030
No.

06:04.864 --> 06:06.449
You've also changed. Look!

06:07.617 --> 06:09.952
I see you no longer trembling
without the binding bracelet.

06:12.413 --> 06:15.500
You're right.
I can freely move my arm now.

06:15.583 --> 06:17.960
The Soul Ejector has made
your energy surge.

06:18.044 --> 06:19.712
When you drank poison, your gate opened

06:19.796 --> 06:21.756
and then allowed it to surge
with the Soul Ejector.

06:22.840 --> 06:26.135
Jang Uk, you have no idea
how incredibly lucky you've been.

06:32.809 --> 06:35.728
I am quite certain that you were there.

06:36.562 --> 06:37.397
What?

06:57.959 --> 06:59.168
Why am I…

07:00.294 --> 07:01.838
the only one like this?

07:01.921 --> 07:04.882
You failed because your energy was
too weak to take over his body.

07:04.966 --> 07:07.093
You're a soul shifter like me.

07:07.176 --> 07:09.011
Naksu, you will also…

07:09.929 --> 07:11.973
turn to stone eventually.

07:13.099 --> 07:15.518
Just like me now and…

07:16.310 --> 07:17.812
just like your father.

07:22.859 --> 07:23.943
My father?

07:24.610 --> 07:25.570
Yes.

07:26.112 --> 07:28.865
Your father,
the constellation recorder mage.

07:29.574 --> 07:30.533
Cho Chung!

07:32.618 --> 07:33.870
My father was…

07:36.914 --> 07:38.082
a soul shifter?

07:41.252 --> 07:46.007
The four families of Daeho were not
the ones who destroyed your entire family.

07:47.550 --> 07:51.304
Your father ran wild
and murdered everyone.

07:53.431 --> 07:55.433
Please, my lady!
You cannot leave here for anything.

07:55.516 --> 07:58.436
If you see your father, just run away.

07:58.519 --> 08:00.146
Please, do not get caught!

08:03.524 --> 08:07.778
Both father and daughter,
taken advantage of, and left to…

08:08.488 --> 08:10.615
be petrified and die.

08:11.782 --> 08:13.784
Is the person
who shifted my father's soul…

08:15.161 --> 08:16.162
the Danju,

08:17.622 --> 08:19.373
Jin Mu as in Cheonbugwan?

08:19.999 --> 08:23.002
Jin Mu is not the true Danju
of our organization.

08:23.711 --> 08:26.464
There is another hidden Danju
who runs everything.

08:27.507 --> 08:29.675
- Then who is that?
- They are someone…

08:30.927 --> 08:33.387
who can prevent you from running wild

08:34.388 --> 08:37.558
because they possess the ice stone.

08:37.642 --> 08:40.228
So who is that? Who's the real one?

09:04.669 --> 09:06.587
Mu-deok, you're all right?

09:08.005 --> 09:09.048
I'll be fine.

09:10.091 --> 09:11.884
Go after him. Hurry!

09:48.713 --> 09:50.548
Before that sorcery's poison spreads

09:50.631 --> 09:52.842
throughout my body,
I have to get out of here.

10:18.200 --> 10:19.327
Search the area.

10:19.410 --> 10:20.244
Yes, sir.

10:44.310 --> 10:45.269
There's no one here.

10:50.858 --> 10:52.735
But it sensed the energy of sorcery.

10:52.818 --> 10:55.905
Master Heo was right.
That Sapsali was really the Gwigu.

10:56.530 --> 10:58.824
Did the alchemy of souls
really take place here?

11:07.917 --> 11:08.834
What is that?

11:09.418 --> 11:10.503
It was just on the ground.

11:11.921 --> 11:13.172
A Soul Ejector.

11:19.011 --> 11:20.137
Look at this.

11:21.055 --> 11:23.057
This is not
Young Master Jang's binding bracelet?

11:23.140 --> 11:24.684
Why do you think it's here then?

11:25.434 --> 11:26.852
Does this mean Uk was here earlier?

11:31.816 --> 11:33.025
There are signs of a fight.

11:33.109 --> 11:35.069
You don't think
anything happened to him, do you?

11:38.614 --> 11:41.200
Sang-ho, return to Songrim
and report what you saw.

11:41.826 --> 11:44.078
Dang-gu, go back
to the fortress and search for Uk.

11:44.161 --> 11:46.080
- I'll look around here.
- Yeah.

12:21.949 --> 12:24.452
How did the Songrim mages
know to come out here?

12:41.594 --> 12:43.345
You're a soul shifter like me.

12:43.929 --> 12:45.639
Naksu, you will also…

12:46.557 --> 12:48.225
turn to stone eventually.

12:48.851 --> 12:50.561
Just like me now,

12:50.644 --> 12:52.897
and just like your father.

12:56.817 --> 12:57.902
Father.

13:22.384 --> 13:24.011
Both father and daughter…

13:25.721 --> 13:28.265
taken advantage of, and left to…

13:29.725 --> 13:31.519
be petrified and die.

15:18.334 --> 15:19.251
Why is it you?

15:20.502 --> 15:22.004
Why does it have to be you again?

15:28.427 --> 15:30.721
Did you… catch her?

15:31.347 --> 15:33.015
This is Uk's servant, Mu-deok.

15:34.391 --> 15:36.685
She's hurt because of me.
She needs to be treated.

15:43.901 --> 15:46.111
Phew, what a day! Not really bad!

15:46.195 --> 15:48.864
Business has been so good today.

15:54.912 --> 15:57.247
I need to refill
my energy before I petrify.

15:59.792 --> 16:01.877
- Are you done?
- Just finished.

16:02.378 --> 16:05.881
Ah, come on,
let's go get a drink then. Hurry up!

16:05.965 --> 16:07.216
Let's go.

16:08.759 --> 16:10.427
I can't return if I cause a scene.

16:11.261 --> 16:13.973
I need to find somewhere quiet
to take someone's energy.

17:05.232 --> 17:06.692
Please, step to the side.

17:08.277 --> 17:09.862
Oh, yeah, sorry. Please, go ahead.

17:10.946 --> 17:11.905
Mage.

17:11.989 --> 17:14.241
We can all see right through
what you're trying to do.

17:15.492 --> 17:18.037
You have been following my lady
since we entered the fortress.

17:25.544 --> 17:27.713
That man has been
following us for a while now.

17:31.633 --> 17:35.012
You stalked her
all throughout the city and to this inn.

17:37.056 --> 17:38.974
There is a misunderstanding.
We're just going the same way.

17:39.058 --> 17:40.684
Misunderstanding!

17:40.768 --> 17:43.562
You were staring only at my lady
the entire time you were following us!

17:43.645 --> 17:44.772
I was not. No.

17:44.855 --> 17:45.856
Sun-i.

17:46.607 --> 17:48.817
That's enough. You're embarrassing him.

17:52.488 --> 17:56.325
Following me all the way to the inn,
puts me in an uncomfortable situation.

17:56.408 --> 17:59.161
If you do not wish me
to find a new inn at such a late hour,

17:59.244 --> 18:00.329
please, go now.

18:01.914 --> 18:03.207
One thing, miss.

18:04.041 --> 18:06.376
What gave you the idea
that I was even following you?

18:06.960 --> 18:08.837
It's not like you owe me
money or anything,

18:08.921 --> 18:10.172
and you're not someone already I know,

18:10.255 --> 18:12.174
so why do you think
I was following you then?

18:12.257 --> 18:13.842
Of course you were,
because my lady is so very pretty--

18:13.926 --> 18:15.219
Sun-i, just shut up for a second.

18:16.762 --> 18:18.388
I only want you to answer me.

18:18.972 --> 18:19.807
Uh…

18:20.682 --> 18:24.770
I have had many men follow me
because they found me very attractive.

18:24.853 --> 18:25.854
So I thought…

18:27.231 --> 18:28.857
you were doing the same thing.

18:29.441 --> 18:30.275
Ah.

18:31.193 --> 18:32.027
Incorrect.

18:34.404 --> 18:35.656
Your looks don't impress me.

18:36.490 --> 18:38.659
I wasn't following you,
so you're wrong there, too.

18:39.910 --> 18:41.203
I-If that's true…

18:43.247 --> 18:44.581
I apologize.

18:44.665 --> 18:46.583
Then I'm free to
go up the stairs right now?

18:59.054 --> 19:01.515
- My lady.
- Huh?

19:01.598 --> 19:03.225
You really must eat something.

19:05.269 --> 19:06.103
Did that scum…

19:07.396 --> 19:08.981
I mean… Do…

19:09.064 --> 19:10.107
Do you dread the possibility

19:10.190 --> 19:11.942
of running into that man again
so you're starving yourself?

19:13.485 --> 19:14.611
That's not why.

19:15.445 --> 19:16.947
I'm just not feeling well.

19:17.531 --> 19:19.283
Change out of those wet clothes.

19:19.366 --> 19:21.493
I'll go and make some porridge for you.

21:02.511 --> 21:04.471
Are you all right?

21:07.015 --> 21:07.891
What was that?

21:08.725 --> 21:09.768
That thing?

21:11.061 --> 21:12.604
Was that the thing you were following?

21:13.480 --> 21:14.314
Yes.

21:16.525 --> 21:18.151
I'm just glad you are unhurt, though.

21:18.986 --> 21:19.861
Please, wait.

21:21.780 --> 21:23.198
Thank you for saving me.

21:23.282 --> 21:24.574
If you're feeling unwell,

21:25.617 --> 21:27.369
visit Sejukwon in Songrim.

21:27.452 --> 21:28.996
Do you really know Sejukwon?

21:29.079 --> 21:30.289
I am Sejukwon's…

21:34.918 --> 21:36.253
Heo Yun-ok.

21:55.939 --> 21:58.608
Seeing as it's in
your possession instead of your friend's,

22:00.277 --> 22:02.154
I'll take it that
your friend is no longer here.

22:05.699 --> 22:06.825
So then you knew…

22:08.994 --> 22:10.495
who I was this entire time.

23:08.095 --> 23:09.346
What was that?

23:11.765 --> 23:13.016
Are you okay?

23:13.100 --> 23:14.810
Hey, are you okay? Are you all right?

23:14.893 --> 23:18.355
T-Try to get up, okay?
Ah, okay, slowly, slowly.

23:21.316 --> 23:22.859
I-It's a monster!

23:24.945 --> 23:25.987
A soul shifter.

23:26.071 --> 23:27.155
Soul shifter!

23:43.630 --> 23:45.715
Run! Run! Get out of here!

24:02.691 --> 24:05.360
There is another hidden Danju
who runs everything.

24:06.486 --> 24:10.157
They are someone
who can prevent you from running wild.

24:10.240 --> 24:12.868
All right, show me
where your Danju is then.

24:15.287 --> 24:16.872
Gil-ju's gone missing?

24:16.955 --> 24:20.709
After he tried to chase
Jang Uk's servant, we lost track of him.

24:22.252 --> 24:23.837
Jang Uk's servant? Why?

24:24.463 --> 24:26.173
Why would he go after her?

24:26.256 --> 24:29.968
In truth, he has been following
Jang Uk for quite a while now.

24:31.011 --> 24:34.723
The Songrim Spirit Plaque
that Naksu had was in fact Jang Uk's.

24:35.474 --> 24:37.058
I believe that he went after Jang Uk

24:37.142 --> 24:38.602
because he thought
he was connected to Naksu.

24:38.685 --> 24:40.812
You should have told me
as soon as you knew!

24:41.521 --> 24:42.772
He ordered me not to.

24:42.856 --> 24:45.233
I thought he wanted to find
evidence before reporting to you.

24:45.817 --> 24:47.944
Order all of the mages
in Cheonbugwan to search for him.

24:54.201 --> 24:55.869
You found Uk's binding bracelet

24:55.952 --> 24:58.413
in the same place as the alchemy of souls?

24:58.497 --> 24:59.998
Dang-gu is looking for Master Jang.

25:00.081 --> 25:02.125
And Young Master Seo is searching
around the temple.

25:02.209 --> 25:04.836
- So, those children were also there, then?
- Yes.

25:04.920 --> 25:08.965
With his abilities, I doubt that
Uk is capable of the alchemy of souls.

25:09.049 --> 25:10.383
Master Lee,

25:10.467 --> 25:12.969
what if someone took over
his body using sorcery?

25:13.053 --> 25:15.597
You have nothing to worry about.
I'm sure he's fine.

25:20.435 --> 25:22.604
That girl will certainly protect him.

25:22.687 --> 25:23.855
By the way,

25:23.939 --> 25:27.150
where did our leader run off to
in the midst of this chaos, huh?

25:28.568 --> 25:30.111
Before Uk was ever born…

25:32.030 --> 25:33.615
close to about 20 years ago…

25:34.658 --> 25:35.492
did Jang Gang

25:36.535 --> 25:38.161
perform the alchemy of souls?

25:43.625 --> 25:45.919
Cheonbugwan's Gwanju performing sorcery?

25:46.711 --> 25:48.046
That is absolutely absurd.

25:48.129 --> 25:49.339
Jin Mu told me all about it.

25:50.966 --> 25:52.884
I couldn't bear to hear it from his mouth,

25:54.427 --> 25:56.012
so I came to you instead.

26:00.475 --> 26:01.518
Madam Do-hwa…

26:03.103 --> 26:04.771
was indeed once concerned about it.

26:05.814 --> 26:08.733
The Gwanju seemed to have
an interest in strange spells.

26:09.568 --> 26:12.779
But it was only…
for a brief amount of time.

26:13.446 --> 26:15.657
For nearly a year, he was hardly home,

26:16.324 --> 26:19.869
and would spend hours
with Jin Mu practicing spells.

26:19.953 --> 26:20.912
However,

26:20.996 --> 26:24.791
after Do-hwa was pregnant
with the Young Master, he soon stopped.

26:28.712 --> 26:30.338
The child that
Do-hwa has given birth to

26:30.880 --> 26:32.424
is the son of the late king.

26:33.258 --> 26:34.134
The late king

26:35.135 --> 26:37.846
died from an illness so severe that,
in his final days, he couldn't even move.

26:37.929 --> 26:39.306
So how is that possible?

26:41.266 --> 26:44.519
With the alchemy of souls,
it would have been possible.

26:46.688 --> 26:48.064
It was nothing more…

26:49.399 --> 26:51.568
than a mage's fleeting curiosity.

26:51.651 --> 26:52.569
It wasn't.

26:53.903 --> 26:55.196
Against Do-hwa…

26:56.698 --> 26:57.949
and Uk as well.

26:58.742 --> 27:02.746
Jang Gang had committed
an unforgivable crime.

27:13.048 --> 27:16.426
A mage from Jeongjingak is here,
urgently searching for the young master.

27:26.227 --> 27:27.937
You were here as well, my lord?

27:28.021 --> 27:29.314
What is it?

27:30.148 --> 27:31.483
Ugh, I'm afraid…

27:32.525 --> 27:34.319
Uk's fallen victim
to the alchemy of souls.

27:35.403 --> 27:36.237
What?

28:00.720 --> 28:01.680
That's Cheonbugwan.

28:02.514 --> 28:05.433
Could the real Danju be in Cheonbugwan?

28:28.957 --> 28:31.501
This goes straight to the royal palace.

28:32.335 --> 28:34.838
Is it possible that
the real Danju is in the palace?

28:45.014 --> 28:46.808
I am here from Cheonbugwan.

28:46.891 --> 28:48.643
More business tonight,
I take it.

28:56.818 --> 28:58.069
Show me your face.

28:58.153 --> 29:00.071
This is urgent. Move aside.

29:00.155 --> 29:01.448
Take off your hood and show me your face!

29:23.970 --> 29:25.013
A soul shifter.

29:27.974 --> 29:28.850
Go!

31:16.875 --> 31:18.877
The real Danju is
inside the palace then.

31:21.462 --> 31:22.797
The ice stone, was it?

31:23.965 --> 31:25.508
That's the name of it, right?

31:27.176 --> 31:30.346
I'll find it, and prevent her
from sharing your fate.

32:05.465 --> 32:06.549
He's alive?

32:26.903 --> 32:29.530
He tried to enter the palace
while running wild.

32:30.740 --> 32:31.991
So, did you and your men kill him?

32:33.076 --> 32:34.494
We didn't dare to.

32:34.577 --> 32:37.413
An unknown mage suddenly appeared
and he used magic to kill him.

32:38.164 --> 32:40.416
Which family was he from?
Did you see his face?

32:40.500 --> 32:42.961
He had it covered
by a blue cloth, I couldn't.

32:43.044 --> 32:44.796
However, I know the spell he used.

32:51.260 --> 32:52.428
It was Tansu.

32:55.890 --> 32:59.394
- Tansu, you say?
- Yes, I'm certain it was Tansu.

32:59.894 --> 33:02.146
He flicked his energy with his sword.

33:04.148 --> 33:06.651
Tansu was Naksu's signature skill.

33:07.318 --> 33:09.779
What other mages use that ability?

33:19.372 --> 33:21.833
I heard that you caught
a soul shifter who ran wild.

33:22.458 --> 33:25.795
We came here to see
with our own eyes who it was.

33:27.088 --> 33:30.008
Of course. Please see it for yourself.

33:53.906 --> 33:54.741
This man…

33:55.908 --> 33:58.703
is Gil-ju, isn't he? One of yours.

34:00.621 --> 34:02.790
So? It is.

34:05.209 --> 34:07.879
Bring his body inside. Send everyone away.

34:07.962 --> 34:08.838
Yes, lord.

34:14.469 --> 34:17.972
Jin Mu was with me
when the alchemy of souls was performed.

34:18.473 --> 34:20.975
He seems just as perplexed.

34:21.059 --> 34:24.395
He wasn't aware
about this soul shifter, either.

34:26.230 --> 34:29.609
Since this incident occurred within
Cheonbugwan, I will investigate it.

34:29.692 --> 34:31.402
Songrim should not intervene.

34:32.111 --> 34:32.987
Of course.

34:33.946 --> 34:36.908
However, if you need our aid,

34:37.492 --> 34:39.827
do not hesitate to ask us.

34:42.330 --> 34:44.874
Another soul shifter was found
running wild?

34:44.957 --> 34:48.586
Fortunately, he was caught
and eventually petrified.

34:48.669 --> 34:50.296
Did they identify the soul shifter?

34:50.797 --> 34:53.633
It was a mage from Cheonbugwan.

34:53.716 --> 34:55.051
The mage Gil-ju.

34:57.095 --> 34:59.639
Gil-ju turned into a soul shifter?

35:00.223 --> 35:03.309
Then he was caught here in Cheonbugwan?

35:03.392 --> 35:05.394
He was caught right
in front of the palace, my king.

35:05.478 --> 35:08.523
He tried to enter the palace
after he was already running wild.

35:09.482 --> 35:11.192
He tried to get into the palace?

35:11.275 --> 35:13.444
Yes. But before he could,
a mage appeared

35:13.528 --> 35:15.655
and subdued him using Tansu, sire.

35:18.991 --> 35:21.035
And do we know who this mage was?

35:22.578 --> 35:24.705
The person who killed
Gil-ju had to be Naksu.

35:24.789 --> 35:26.040
Naksu? Really?

35:26.124 --> 35:27.542
Naksu has really returned!

35:27.625 --> 35:29.502
- Naksu came back?
- The assassin Naksu?

35:30.044 --> 35:31.337
That mage last night who appeared

35:31.420 --> 35:34.090
in front of the palace had to use
Tansu to stop him.

35:34.173 --> 35:35.967
The very same skill that Naksu uses!

35:39.303 --> 35:40.596
Hang on! Just a moment!

35:40.680 --> 35:42.014
Isn't Naksu dead?

35:42.098 --> 35:42.932
He's right. She is dead.

35:43.015 --> 35:45.977
She has to be dead. Everyone
in this city watched her body burn.

35:46.060 --> 35:48.396
Even I saw it with my own two eyes.
So what do you say?

35:48.479 --> 35:49.438
Yeah, he's right.

35:49.522 --> 35:52.150
Her body may have burned,
but her soul is still here.

35:52.233 --> 35:55.611
The Shadow Assassin, Naksu,
must have returned as a soul shifter!

35:55.695 --> 35:57.363
What?

35:59.448 --> 36:01.325
But Naksu is a woman, isn't she?

36:01.409 --> 36:03.452
They're saying a man killed Gil-ju.

36:03.536 --> 36:06.706
He was a tall, young man
who had a blue cloth covering his face.

36:07.373 --> 36:09.375
Naksu shifted her soul, didn't she?

36:09.458 --> 36:12.128
She could have shifted
into that tall man's body.

36:12.211 --> 36:13.421
Ah!

36:13.921 --> 36:16.132
Then she could have become even stronger.

36:17.341 --> 36:19.010
Naksu was already so powerful.

36:19.093 --> 36:20.344
Now she's pretty much invincible,

36:20.428 --> 36:22.555
now that she's shifted
into a much stronger body.

36:24.765 --> 36:26.184
She must have murdered Gil-ju

36:26.267 --> 36:28.686
in order to get her revenge on Cheonbugwan

36:29.395 --> 36:30.897
for burning her body and killing her men.

36:30.980 --> 36:31.939
Why us though…

36:32.481 --> 36:34.400
when it was actually Songrim
that killed Naksu?

36:35.359 --> 36:37.778
So, then "Naksu, who has returned

36:37.862 --> 36:40.114
as this invincible being
dressed in blue cloth,

36:40.198 --> 36:42.783
has set her next target as Songrim".

36:42.867 --> 36:46.037
At least, that's the rumor
that I've overheard there.

36:46.120 --> 36:48.581
It's been less than half a day
since they were captured,

36:49.081 --> 36:50.875
and already
people are spreading such lies.

36:51.459 --> 36:55.254
Rumors like that spread
like wildfire and are often exaggerated.

36:55.338 --> 36:57.006
But that rumor isn't without some truth.

36:57.089 --> 37:00.051
They're saying that the mage
who killed Gil-ju used Tansu,

37:00.134 --> 37:02.511
and that's the skill Naksu used to use.

37:02.595 --> 37:04.513
Who says that Naksu is
the only one who can use Tansu?

37:06.098 --> 37:08.809
That's the skill that even I could master
if I wanted to right now.

37:08.893 --> 37:10.519
Oh, but…

37:10.603 --> 37:12.813
If I ever hear such rumors in Songrim,

37:13.397 --> 37:15.483
I will assume that
you were the one who spread them, Dang-gu.

37:15.566 --> 37:16.484
So don't let it happen.

37:17.276 --> 37:18.110
Sir.

37:21.697 --> 37:24.700
At least, I can be relieved
that the dead soul shifter

37:24.784 --> 37:26.202
was not the Young Master.

37:27.119 --> 37:30.331
But then, why were his items found
all the way up there?

37:31.499 --> 37:34.210
We will have our answer once we find him.

37:40.258 --> 37:42.802
Oh, you don't look so good.

37:49.517 --> 37:51.018
So…

37:52.186 --> 37:54.522
please, go home and wait for Jang Uk.

38:04.865 --> 38:06.575
Do you feel unwell?

38:07.201 --> 38:10.246
I was so surprised
that last night's honey biscuits

38:10.329 --> 38:12.331
have been giving me indigestion.

38:14.375 --> 38:17.336
When I had heard that
the Young Master's soul had been shifted,

38:17.420 --> 38:19.755
my soul shifted in and out of my own body.

38:27.847 --> 38:30.308
Did your soul really return here?

38:33.227 --> 38:34.562
Is that really you?

38:35.396 --> 38:37.898
No, my lord. I'm Maidservant Park.

38:39.317 --> 38:41.193
Maybe then,
I could smack Young Master Park

38:41.277 --> 38:42.737
for scaring me like that.

38:44.822 --> 38:46.240
You can hit me instead.

38:48.617 --> 38:50.745
For Maidservant Park, of course.

38:51.787 --> 38:52.872
Go on and hit me.

38:52.955 --> 38:54.707
Maid Park has quite a good arm.

38:54.790 --> 38:56.625
Even someone like you can get hurt by it.

38:57.626 --> 38:59.837
I promise that I won't whine
if it ends up hurting,

38:59.920 --> 39:01.213
so go on and hit me.

39:01.797 --> 39:02.923
Oh!

39:04.842 --> 39:07.762
This means that you now owe me.

39:09.096 --> 39:10.389
What do you mean?

39:11.098 --> 39:13.225
Are you going to do something to upset me?

39:13.309 --> 39:15.811
If that's the case,
please, just take it back.

39:15.895 --> 39:17.229
Hit me once so we're even.

39:18.064 --> 39:19.190
Go on. Hit me!

39:20.149 --> 39:21.609
Go ahead and hit me.

39:27.281 --> 39:28.491
I don't want…

39:30.242 --> 39:31.911
…to ever see you get hurt.

39:34.288 --> 39:36.457
There is so much that I need to protect,

39:37.500 --> 39:40.461
so I may have to be harsh
and ruthless from time to time.

39:41.128 --> 39:42.296
But I do promise you

39:43.589 --> 39:45.174
I never wish to hurt you.

39:50.930 --> 39:52.223
Are you then troubled

39:52.807 --> 39:54.100
of what you asked me yesterday?

39:55.059 --> 39:56.268
About Master Jang Gang?

39:56.852 --> 39:58.813
There's been a lot of disorder lately.

39:58.896 --> 40:00.898
And I have failed to be impartial

40:01.899 --> 40:03.859
as the current leader of Songrim.

40:04.819 --> 40:06.946
But after you hit me,
I've come to my senses.

40:07.780 --> 40:10.991
And now will resolve
the problems critically, too.

40:15.162 --> 40:17.081
So, turn into Maidservant Park and…

40:18.416 --> 40:20.000
hit me every now and then, would you?

40:21.919 --> 40:22.837
I will…

40:24.088 --> 40:25.673
allow that for you.

40:40.312 --> 40:41.147
Oh.

40:41.856 --> 40:42.773
What are you doing here?

40:43.274 --> 40:45.818
I was ordered to find
the origin of the sorcery.

40:45.901 --> 40:48.195
Then I found this out here.

40:49.196 --> 40:50.823
Ah, I must have left that behind.

40:52.741 --> 40:54.285
Do you not need the binding bracelet?

40:55.327 --> 40:57.121
No. I guess I'm fine now.

40:57.830 --> 41:00.291
I can't believe I almost lost
another Jin family treasure.

41:01.375 --> 41:02.626
Thank you for finding it.

41:04.044 --> 41:05.754
You also left something else behind.

41:07.047 --> 41:08.883
Did you forget about Mu-deok?

41:10.926 --> 41:11.969
Mu-deok you said?

41:13.762 --> 41:15.347
I found her hiding in the forest.

41:16.807 --> 41:19.727
Injured. Lost quite a bit of blood.

41:35.075 --> 41:35.951
Mu-deok.

41:37.161 --> 41:39.288
Ah, Young Master. Come on.

41:39.371 --> 41:41.832
How could you dare run off
and leave me all on my own?

41:41.916 --> 41:42.917
What?

41:44.668 --> 41:48.130
Hey, you just selfishly ran away
and left me to fend for myself.

41:48.964 --> 41:50.466
Just play along. Play along!

41:54.178 --> 41:57.264
Right, I did. Yeah, I, uh, I ran away.

41:57.848 --> 41:58.807
Yeah.

41:58.891 --> 42:00.309
We came to shelter from the rain

42:00.392 --> 42:02.186
and we were unlucky
to witness the sorcery.

42:02.269 --> 42:04.605
But because you ran off
leaving me to my own devices,

42:04.688 --> 42:06.941
I almost got ripped apart
by that soul shifter.

42:09.443 --> 42:10.486
I'm sorry, Mu-deok.

42:11.487 --> 42:15.866
I was just so scared, and I wasn't even
thinking when I ran to save my own life.

42:17.368 --> 42:20.746
Yul thought Mu-deok was
the soul shifter and he nearly killed her.

42:21.413 --> 42:24.875
If he hadn't treated her right away,
she would have died.

42:30.005 --> 42:31.465
Oh, Yul, you--

42:31.549 --> 42:32.925
Wow, you rescued Mu-deok, and you…

42:33.008 --> 42:35.553
and you even treated her.
That was kind! Wow!

42:41.350 --> 42:43.143
Did you really run away
and leave her behind?

42:48.941 --> 42:50.901
If I'd fought, I'm sure
I would just have died.

42:51.402 --> 42:53.445
We need to be a bit selfish sometimes.

42:54.572 --> 42:56.407
Why are you staring?
Don't you agree?

42:57.825 --> 43:01.328
Regardless, I'm all right
and you're fine as well, Young Master.

43:01.870 --> 43:02.871
So, it's all fine.

43:19.597 --> 43:21.432
I heard you were hiding in Danhyanggok.

43:22.016 --> 43:23.892
Did you hear that our leader

43:23.976 --> 43:26.103
held Songrim accountable
for your own dishonor?

43:26.186 --> 43:27.688
Oh, this old man.

43:28.439 --> 43:30.858
Why would he do that
if I'm not allowed into Songrim?

43:30.941 --> 43:33.068
The duel with the Crown Prince
is in about two weeks.

43:33.694 --> 43:35.654
Until then, just stay out of the fortress,

43:35.738 --> 43:37.281
and don't create any more trouble.

43:37.364 --> 43:38.574
Continue to lie low.

43:44.580 --> 43:46.832
Thank you very much
for treating my injury.

43:46.915 --> 43:49.001
Uk seems fine
without the binding bracelet on him.

43:50.085 --> 43:52.296
I suppose he can control
his energy on his arm now.

43:54.590 --> 43:57.468
Once again, he risked his life
and got exactly what he had wanted.

43:57.551 --> 43:59.053
Once again, you're with him.

44:01.930 --> 44:05.643
If I'm such a bother to you,
you should have just left me to die then.

44:06.268 --> 44:07.102
Next time…

44:09.146 --> 44:10.564
I might have to do just that.

44:17.237 --> 44:18.072
Mu-deok.

44:19.698 --> 44:20.949
Yes. Coming, Young Master.

44:23.619 --> 44:24.495
Let's go now.

44:30.626 --> 44:32.670
Uk is fine. He's not injured.

44:33.587 --> 44:34.505
I'm glad.

44:35.422 --> 44:38.425
Did you happen to see who was with Gil-ju

44:38.509 --> 44:39.927
when he shifted his soul?

44:40.010 --> 44:42.930
That person probably was
the one with the blue cloth.

44:43.013 --> 44:45.432
He said he was focused on running.
He didn't see anyone.

44:45.516 --> 44:47.184
What about Jang Uk's servant then?

44:48.644 --> 44:50.396
She might have witnessed
the spell he used.

44:53.399 --> 44:54.233
Mu-deok…

45:00.656 --> 45:02.866
probably wouldn't even know
what she was looking at.

45:04.034 --> 45:06.787
After all, she's nothing
more than an ordinary servant.

45:09.456 --> 45:11.625
What is wrong with your hand?

45:13.377 --> 45:14.211
How did it get injured?

45:16.755 --> 45:19.800
When I touched the Soul Ejector,
some of the poison burned me.

45:20.634 --> 45:21.719
Honestly, I'm fine.

45:23.387 --> 45:24.763
Would you please excuse me?

46:02.885 --> 46:04.720
So what do you want from me this time?

46:06.597 --> 46:08.682
I heard my wedding gifts
arrived the other day,

46:08.766 --> 46:10.809
and that you had taken them,
Young Master Park.

46:11.894 --> 46:12.770
Why?

46:12.853 --> 46:15.981
Were you worried I might lash out
and destroy them if I saw them all?

46:16.064 --> 46:17.357
I can keep them stored for you

46:17.441 --> 46:19.902
and then give them back
to you at your next wedding.

46:20.611 --> 46:22.029
Just throw them away.

46:22.112 --> 46:24.573
I'll never get married
to anyone, not after this.

46:25.616 --> 46:27.576
You don't have to be
embarrassed by any of this.

46:27.659 --> 46:30.204
This time, your marriage was
arranged in secret,

46:30.287 --> 46:31.580
so how many people can know about it?

46:34.166 --> 46:35.167
You-- You think so?

46:35.250 --> 46:36.418
Mm.

46:37.419 --> 46:39.546
- Cho-yeon! Hey!
- Cho-yeon!

46:43.175 --> 46:44.927
Cho-yeon! I heard
you're getting married again.

46:45.552 --> 46:47.513
Did I hear right that
you already bought wedding gifts

46:47.596 --> 46:49.306
and hired a craftsman to make your rings.

46:49.389 --> 46:52.142
It seems people have found out.

46:52.226 --> 46:53.143
Congrats!

46:53.227 --> 46:56.063
Congratulations, Young Master Park.

46:56.146 --> 46:58.816
- What? Me?
- I heard you two are getting married.

46:58.899 --> 47:00.734
He's the one who accepted
the wedding gifts,

47:00.818 --> 47:02.653
and went with you to pick up your rings.

47:02.736 --> 47:03.862
That true?

47:03.946 --> 47:06.782
There was an absurd rumor floating
around that you are marrying Uk again.

47:07.366 --> 47:08.325
But that's not true, right?

47:08.408 --> 47:10.077
You're marrying Young Master Park, right?

47:11.745 --> 47:12.788
Yes, that's true.

47:12.871 --> 47:14.790
Uh, but could you keep quiet for now?

47:14.873 --> 47:15.958
It's still a secret.

47:16.917 --> 47:18.043
Sure.

47:18.669 --> 47:19.837
See you later.

47:21.088 --> 47:23.465
See! I told you it had to be Dang-gu.

47:23.549 --> 47:25.384
She's not crazy…

47:30.973 --> 47:32.057
Young Master Park,

47:32.140 --> 47:33.934
why did you tell them
we were getting married?

47:34.518 --> 47:36.812
Instead of you
being rejected by him twice,

47:37.437 --> 47:40.232
let's say that you were the one
who dumped me this time.

47:40.315 --> 47:42.109
After all, it will just be a rumor.

47:43.735 --> 47:46.029
Would you be all right doing that?

47:46.989 --> 47:48.532
You'll end up being embarrassed.

47:49.783 --> 47:50.993
That will be fine by me.

48:18.979 --> 48:19.938
Filthy Mu-deok?

48:21.523 --> 48:23.984
Are you back here again?
Are you all right?

48:24.985 --> 48:25.986
Pardon?

48:28.906 --> 48:30.449
Never mind. You can go.

48:35.579 --> 48:37.706
Are you looking for Mu-deok again, sire?

48:37.789 --> 48:40.709
No, I'm not.
Her dress just looked familiar to me.

48:40.792 --> 48:41.835
Ah!

48:41.919 --> 48:44.212
Mu-deok sold us that dress a few days ago.

48:45.130 --> 48:47.132
- She sold that dress to you?
- Yes.

48:47.215 --> 48:49.551
She said some thoughtless,
young men had given it to her.

48:50.218 --> 48:51.637
She sold the dress saying that

48:51.720 --> 48:53.680
he was well-off and wouldn't want it back.

48:55.307 --> 48:57.935
Did filthy Mu-deok
really say that about it?

48:58.018 --> 49:01.813
Yes. Filthy Mu-deok and silk
do not pair well after all, of course.

49:02.773 --> 49:04.024
Watch what you say about her.

49:04.775 --> 49:05.651
Sorry?

49:05.734 --> 49:09.112
Filthy Mu-deok is my name for her.
Only I can call her that.

49:09.196 --> 49:10.322
Don't call her that.

49:10.405 --> 49:12.324
Uh, I'm sorry, sire.

49:14.076 --> 49:15.118
Also…

49:17.204 --> 49:19.498
Filthy Mu-deok wore it surprisingly well.

49:20.207 --> 49:22.584
At least, she looked
better than you in that blue shawl.

49:23.168 --> 49:24.836
This must be much uglier than I thought.

49:26.672 --> 49:27.673
What is it?

49:27.756 --> 49:30.384
When I came in, I noticed
that everyone is wearing one.

49:30.467 --> 49:32.511
This is the cloth that Naksu wore.

49:32.594 --> 49:33.637
Whose cloth?

49:33.720 --> 49:35.764
The soul shifter Naksu killed
in front of the palace

49:35.847 --> 49:37.099
was a mage from Cheonbugwan.

49:37.683 --> 49:39.851
Supposedly, she wore
a blue cloth just like this one.

49:39.935 --> 49:43.563
Wearing a blue cloth has become
quite a trend throughout the fortress.

49:49.111 --> 49:51.238
Come! Come buy Naksu's blue cloth.

49:52.447 --> 49:54.199
It can even block the alchemy of souls!

49:54.282 --> 49:55.701
Oh my, let me see.

50:05.168 --> 50:07.254
The soul shifter in blue, Naksu.

50:08.380 --> 50:10.632
Even the people are certain
to think Naksu is back.

50:12.342 --> 50:16.179
But of course, thanks to
the appearance of the Naksu in Blue,

50:16.263 --> 50:18.932
they're not talking about
Uk's match with the Prince.

50:20.100 --> 50:22.019
I wonder where Uk and Mu-deok have gone.

50:23.186 --> 50:24.563
They didn't go back to Danhyanggok.

50:25.439 --> 50:26.898
I'm sure they're somewhere safe.

50:27.607 --> 50:30.235
They'll return… at least for the fight.

50:32.696 --> 50:34.322
Uh, by the way…

50:36.908 --> 50:38.618
I got one too. Do you want to try it on?

50:44.332 --> 50:45.167
Hmm…

50:46.084 --> 50:47.002
Wow!

50:49.880 --> 50:52.424
Who do you think they are?
This Naksu in Blue

50:52.507 --> 50:55.677
who uses Tansu just like her,
wearing a blue cloth?

50:58.513 --> 50:59.347
Hmm.

51:03.560 --> 51:06.313
You said this is
the grave site of soul shifters, right?

51:07.397 --> 51:08.982
Then he must be down there as well.

51:10.859 --> 51:11.985
Your father, I mean.

51:13.945 --> 51:15.072
As a little girl,

51:16.073 --> 51:19.826
I thought he was unjustly murdered
by the mages of the four families.

51:21.536 --> 51:24.122
When Jin Mu took me in,
I served him as the Danju.

51:24.206 --> 51:25.040
But now…

51:26.917 --> 51:29.503
it turned out that my own father
practiced sorcery, and…

51:31.129 --> 51:33.423
they just abandoned me after they used me.

51:37.010 --> 51:38.553
It will be just like what Gil-ju said,

51:39.679 --> 51:41.431
I'll eventually run wild like him.

51:46.269 --> 51:47.687
Once I turn to stone…

51:52.109 --> 51:53.777
will you bury me here like the others?

52:05.205 --> 52:09.376
He said something about the real Danju
and I found where the real Danju is now.

52:11.044 --> 52:14.089
The palace. They're in the palace.

52:18.552 --> 52:21.304
Please tell me
what you know about the ice stone.

52:23.098 --> 52:24.349
Are you certain

52:24.432 --> 52:26.017
that the ice stone
known to have been destroyed

52:26.101 --> 52:28.145
by Master Seo Gyeong 200 years ago

52:29.604 --> 52:33.316
has truly been rid
from this world, Hemp Master Lee?

52:36.111 --> 52:37.529
Is it at all possible…

52:39.364 --> 52:40.740
it's still in Songrim?

53:01.928 --> 53:03.847
It is good to see you, Danju.

53:20.155 --> 53:21.698
Gil-ju was in search of the ice stone

53:21.781 --> 53:23.992
and went to the palace
to request an audience with me.

53:24.993 --> 53:26.119
I wasn't aware

53:27.120 --> 53:30.248
that Gil-ju knew the truth
about you being the real Danju.

53:30.332 --> 53:32.792
Soon comes the day
the Choi family regains power,

53:32.876 --> 53:36.796
and Songrim which caused
our family's downfall will be destroyed.

53:38.798 --> 53:42.010
And the entire kingdom
of Daeho will be under my control.

53:43.762 --> 53:46.014
I, too, have been waiting
for that day to come.

53:47.724 --> 53:51.186
We must find the person who followed
Gil-ju to the palace before killing him.

53:52.646 --> 53:55.106
He must have known that
Gil-ju was after the ice stone,

53:55.190 --> 53:57.943
and followed him to the palace,
hoping to find the stone.

53:58.026 --> 54:00.987
If that individual knows
that the ice stone is in the palace,

54:01.071 --> 54:02.530
you must go and find them,

54:03.615 --> 54:04.908
and then you must kill them.

54:09.496 --> 54:10.956
I don't know who it is,

54:11.957 --> 54:13.583
but he said
the real Danju is in the palace

54:13.667 --> 54:16.753
with the ice stone which could prevent
a soul shifter from ever running wild.

54:18.838 --> 54:22.092
Are you suggesting we break into
the palace and search for the Danju?

54:22.175 --> 54:24.177
It is impossible at my current level.

54:24.970 --> 54:27.973
I'm just a low-skilled mage
who was rejected by Jeongjingak.

54:28.056 --> 54:30.642
However, I'll keep improving.

54:31.768 --> 54:34.271
I'll keep climbing
until I reach the palace.

54:35.855 --> 54:36.773
Master.

54:38.149 --> 54:39.067
I will find…

54:40.443 --> 54:41.820
the ice stone for you.

54:47.325 --> 54:48.159
Jang Uk.

54:49.244 --> 54:51.579
I am not a master
who is strong enough to pull you up,

54:52.664 --> 54:55.333
and I'm not strong enough
to support you even from the bottom.

54:57.002 --> 55:00.046
It's not like you've ever really
encouraged me or supported me, either.

55:00.714 --> 55:02.299
You'd rather push me to my death.

55:05.802 --> 55:07.429
But as you pushed me and pushed me,

55:07.512 --> 55:10.348
I found I've reached a new level
I could never even imagine.

55:13.518 --> 55:15.353
So please, stay by my side,

55:15.937 --> 55:17.564
and keep pushing me that way.

55:27.532 --> 55:28.366
Fine.

55:29.701 --> 55:31.828
I will continue to stay by your side,

55:31.911 --> 55:34.247
but if you stop, I'll push you to death.

56:01.775 --> 56:04.861
I'll go find Uk and make sure
he doesn't come to the duel, just in case.

56:06.696 --> 56:07.864
There's no need.

56:08.531 --> 56:10.867
If he does intend
to show his face at the duel,

56:11.743 --> 56:12.702
do not stop him.

56:12.786 --> 56:15.455
This is a legitimate duel
between two mages.

56:16.206 --> 56:18.416
No one is allowed to intervene
if one of them were to die.

56:20.543 --> 56:22.295
If he ends up dying during the fight,

56:24.255 --> 56:25.757
then there's nothing we can do.

56:30.178 --> 56:31.721
So you won't stop it then?

56:35.683 --> 56:38.353
Uk's accepted the duel
on behalf of Songrim

56:38.436 --> 56:40.522
as it was agreed upon by the Assembly.

56:41.439 --> 56:43.358
Whether he runs away dishonorably,

56:44.067 --> 56:46.069
or honorably fights to his death,

56:46.945 --> 56:51.825
I will simply watch over
whatever happens as Songrim's leader.

58:23.958 --> 58:28.046
Now presenting the king,
and queen of Daeho!

59:01.329 --> 59:04.123
One month ago,
Go Won of the royal house Go

59:04.207 --> 59:06.834
had sent the eldest son
of the Jang family, Jang Uk,

59:06.918 --> 59:07.752
a challenge to a duel.

59:07.835 --> 59:11.589
And Songrim received
the challenge on Uk's behalf.

59:11.673 --> 59:14.217
Any mage who signs
the agreement to the duel

59:14.300 --> 59:16.469
is unable to hold
their opponent responsible

59:17.470 --> 59:20.515
for anything that could happen,
even if this duel ends in their death.

59:22.225 --> 59:26.604
The duel will commence
right at twelve o'clock.

59:26.688 --> 59:28.773
If he does not arrive by noon,

59:29.566 --> 59:31.568
it will be considered his defeat.

59:34.279 --> 59:37.448
You should mention
his punishment that he'll receive

59:37.532 --> 59:39.284
if he ends up forfeiting the duel.

59:42.579 --> 59:47.166
If Jang Uk forfeits the duel
to the Prince and does not appear,

59:47.959 --> 59:51.838
Jang Uk's right to become
the next Gwanju of Cheonbugwan…

59:53.965 --> 59:55.383
will be stripped.

01:00:16.571 --> 01:00:17.405
Yeom-su.

01:00:19.157 --> 01:00:20.992
What are those over there for?

01:00:22.785 --> 01:00:24.454
They're just jars
filled with water.

01:00:25.038 --> 01:00:26.372
Filled with water?

01:00:59.280 --> 01:01:01.240
Excuse me, sir, it's now noon.

01:01:01.324 --> 01:01:03.284
Close the doors to the Training Center.

01:01:04.494 --> 01:01:05.536
I will announce…

01:01:06.913 --> 01:01:08.414
that Jang Uk has forfeited.

01:01:28.476 --> 01:01:29.394
Close the doors.

01:01:43.533 --> 01:01:46.285
Uh, Jang Uk--
Jang Uk's just entered!

01:01:55.044 --> 01:01:55.962
Young Master…

01:02:26.659 --> 01:02:27.660
Young Master.

01:02:29.245 --> 01:02:30.246
I'll be fine for sure.

01:02:34.792 --> 01:02:37.128
JANG UK

01:02:57.440 --> 01:02:59.400
Now that you've signed
the challenge contract,

01:02:59.484 --> 01:03:00.985
even if you die during the duel,

01:03:01.736 --> 01:03:03.613
no one may intervene.

01:03:04.947 --> 01:03:06.115
I am aware of that.

01:03:09.827 --> 01:03:11.037
Mother.

01:03:11.120 --> 01:03:14.373
Use our family's plaque
to put a stop to this duel.

01:03:14.457 --> 01:03:17.293
If he battles the Crown Prince,
Jang Uk is going to die.

01:03:17.376 --> 01:03:19.378
He showed up here
because he is ready to die.

01:03:20.463 --> 01:03:22.173
Your marriage no longer matters.

01:03:22.256 --> 01:03:24.926
Whether he dies or not,
it's no longer our concern.

01:03:38.523 --> 01:03:39.899
The duel may commence.

01:04:09.095 --> 01:04:11.305
At first, you must only defend.

01:04:11.389 --> 01:04:13.558
If you try to face him head-on
at your current skill level,

01:04:15.101 --> 01:04:16.269
you'll certainly die.

01:04:18.187 --> 01:04:20.106
You must wait and bide
your time for the moment

01:04:21.274 --> 01:04:22.859
he loses his concentration.

01:05:00.897 --> 01:05:02.857
He should have placed them
where I asked him to.

01:05:02.940 --> 01:05:05.651
Master Lee, you went to Songrim
from time to time, right?

01:05:06.694 --> 01:05:07.653
Yes. And?

01:05:08.905 --> 01:05:10.448
I have a favor to ask you.

01:05:11.032 --> 01:05:13.659
Would you be able to put
some water in the Training Center

01:05:13.743 --> 01:05:15.036
so he can use Tansu in the duel?

01:05:29.216 --> 01:05:32.219
It is very suspicious
that those jars have been placed there.

01:05:33.930 --> 01:05:34.889
Go and break them.

01:06:34.699 --> 01:06:35.741
Young Master.

01:06:47.420 --> 01:06:48.546
Tansu?

01:07:06.480 --> 01:07:07.440
Huh?

01:07:07.523 --> 01:07:08.399
The match…

01:07:09.150 --> 01:07:10.317
has ended.

01:07:15.364 --> 01:07:17.700
You must have cheated. It's a sham.

01:07:27.543 --> 01:07:29.920
What he just performed was Tansu.

01:07:30.004 --> 01:07:32.965
A skill that only those
who have reached Chisu are able to do.

01:07:33.841 --> 01:07:37.094
How can someone
whose gate was just opened use Tansu?

01:07:37.678 --> 01:07:39.013
I have no doubt

01:07:39.096 --> 01:07:42.349
that a master among us has helped him.

01:07:42.433 --> 01:07:45.561
Listen! All the mages
gathered today saw everything.

01:07:45.644 --> 01:07:47.480
How could anyone have helped him?

01:07:47.563 --> 01:07:49.023
Don't be so pig-headed!

01:07:49.648 --> 01:07:51.609
Jang Uk, why don't you tell us?

01:07:51.692 --> 01:07:54.236
Could you have really managed
to learn Tansu so quickly

01:07:54.320 --> 01:07:56.030
without first mastering Chisu?

01:07:57.573 --> 01:07:58.908
No, it's not like that.

01:07:59.825 --> 01:08:01.827
I still don't know how to gather energy,

01:08:01.911 --> 01:08:04.163
so I can only use Tansu
if I have water around, sir.

01:08:04.747 --> 01:08:07.458
I was only able to learn
how to flick water with it.

01:08:07.541 --> 01:08:09.835
But then who is your master
that taught you that?

01:08:11.629 --> 01:08:14.423
You must have a master
who taught you how to use that ability.

01:08:17.009 --> 01:08:18.052
I don't have one.

01:08:19.970 --> 01:08:21.013
Look at him.

01:08:21.722 --> 01:08:23.182
He's delusional
if he thinks that he can claim that

01:08:23.265 --> 01:08:25.726
he learned the technique without a master.

01:08:28.896 --> 01:08:32.191
Earlier today, I spotted some water jars
that someone had placed for him.

01:08:33.192 --> 01:08:35.194
Who was willing to put them there for you?

01:08:37.029 --> 01:08:38.739
Could it be your master?

01:08:40.616 --> 01:08:42.076
I trained all on my own without masters.

01:08:42.159 --> 01:08:43.536
Tell me the truth right now!

01:08:43.619 --> 01:08:45.538
Jang Uk, explain yourself.

01:08:48.958 --> 01:08:52.086
Who's been helping you learn
how to cast spells all this time?

01:09:02.221 --> 01:09:03.305
I did.

01:09:15.943 --> 01:09:17.528
I'm the one who was with him.

01:09:18.320 --> 01:09:21.490
Everything Jang Uk just said
is the absolute truth.

01:09:25.161 --> 01:09:26.328
And who are you?

01:09:27.246 --> 01:09:29.165
How dare you try to intervene?

01:09:29.248 --> 01:09:30.332
Shut your mouth!

01:09:31.041 --> 01:09:33.794
That man is the former pupil
of Master Seo Gyeong,

01:09:33.878 --> 01:09:35.546
the Great Master Lee Cheol!

01:09:35.629 --> 01:09:38.007
All of you, show some respect!

01:09:40.843 --> 01:09:42.678
Oh, uh… Master.

01:09:45.514 --> 01:09:48.934
I witnessed everything while
he was living with me in Danhyanggok.

01:09:49.018 --> 01:09:51.729
Every day, he's practiced
flicking water droplets with his sword.

01:09:54.940 --> 01:09:56.483
And the only one at his side…

01:09:57.985 --> 01:10:00.112
was no one other than his young servant.

01:10:02.406 --> 01:10:05.451
Master Lee has vouched for Jang Uk.

01:10:07.661 --> 01:10:11.957
Do you have any further objections?

01:10:22.259 --> 01:10:23.886
Incredible!

01:10:46.951 --> 01:10:48.535
Let us go, Your Majesty.

01:10:56.126 --> 01:10:57.461
I knew he can do it.

01:11:05.636 --> 01:11:08.389
Bring Jang Uk into Cheonbugwan somehow.

01:11:20.985 --> 01:11:24.947
The only son of the Gwanju
Jang Gang is truly incredible.

01:11:25.030 --> 01:11:26.365
And since you have no master,

01:11:26.448 --> 01:11:30.077
Cheonbugwan will be
more than happy to take you in.

01:11:30.869 --> 01:11:32.746
What kind of nonsense
are you saying?

01:11:32.830 --> 01:11:35.165
If you really think about it,
I should be his master.

01:11:35.249 --> 01:11:38.377
After all, I'm the one who opened
his gate and gave him my energy.

01:11:38.460 --> 01:11:40.879
Uk, come to Sejukwon.

01:11:40.963 --> 01:11:43.257
I promise
I will teach you everything, huh?

01:11:43.340 --> 01:11:45.592
How about coming to Jinyowon?

01:11:47.344 --> 01:11:49.179
Since you and Cho-yeon were once engaged,

01:11:49.263 --> 01:11:52.516
we will consider you as family
and teach you our own techniques.

01:11:56.979 --> 01:11:57.938
Jang Uk.

01:11:59.064 --> 01:12:01.317
If you wish to still join Jeongjingak…

01:12:03.027 --> 01:12:04.111
we'll accept you.

01:12:23.505 --> 01:12:24.631
Mu-deok.

01:12:24.715 --> 01:12:28.469
They're all asking me to go join them.
Where should I go now?

01:12:40.939 --> 01:12:42.733
You should join Songrim
for the time being,

01:12:43.609 --> 01:12:44.735
Young Master.

01:12:54.745 --> 01:12:56.830
I, Jang Uk of the Jang family,

01:12:57.623 --> 01:12:59.500
choose to join Songrim's Jeongjingak.

01:13:56.723 --> 01:13:59.852
Young Master has become
a mage of Jeongjingak.

01:13:59.935 --> 01:14:01.603
There will be a welcome party

01:14:01.687 --> 01:14:03.730
for our new fellow mage, Jang Uk.

01:14:03.814 --> 01:14:05.983
I hate your master so much.
It is gut-wrenching.

01:14:06.066 --> 01:14:06.984
Oh, of course you do.

01:14:09.736 --> 01:14:11.989
If they look elsewhere, then let them.

01:14:12.072 --> 01:14:13.031
Please let me in.

01:14:13.115 --> 01:14:13.949
Mu-deok.

01:14:14.032 --> 01:14:16.368
I will not be separated
from my Young Master.

01:14:16.452 --> 01:14:17.578
For now, go home and wait.

01:14:17.661 --> 01:14:19.997
Young Master Jang snuck out
and has come home.

01:14:20.080 --> 01:14:22.624
Look! Young master! Just wait there.

01:14:22.708 --> 01:14:24.877
- I'll be there soon, too.
- I found the exam papers.

01:14:25.544 --> 01:14:27.379
Please tell Young Master Jang,

01:14:27.463 --> 01:14:30.591
no matter what happens,
I will come to find him in Songrim.

01:14:30.674 --> 01:14:33.677
I need to find Mu-deok.
I'll fight harder.
